        "content": "## TravelTrust API — Indexer (example)\n\n- **Metrics**: `GET /metrics` on the API scrape target (Prometheus).\n- **Also scraped (120)**: `traveltrust_database_connected`, `traveltrust_chain_config_loaded` — align with **`GET /meta.database_connected`** and chain RPC config mount (see **04 §7.10**).\n- **DB `orders` ↔ `orders_projection` reconcile** is **not** in `/metrics`. Use **`scripts/indexer-reconcile-probe.sh`**, **`internal-indexer-ops.sh probe`**, or **`ops/monitoring/github-actions-indexer-probe.example.yml`** / **K8s CronJob** (see **RUNBOOK §2.55**, **110**).\n- **Datasource**: import then map **Prometheus** UID (replace `prometheus` in panels if needed).",
